        "title": "Reclaim idle chat sessions and cancelled turn-slot reservations",
        "summary": "The chat server now evicts unused harness connections and stale replay handles before opening new ones, and cancelling a queued turn correctly frees its slot.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Chat sessions are tracked in a dedicated registry with a last_used_at timestamp, and new sessions now call make_room_for_chat_session so only unborrowed, idle entries are evicted while in-flight and queued turns stay intact.",
